    narr:generatedFrom "d60479f4df57bd74c60ef357e16a3ce7cbb09a43" ;
    narr:narration """A call with a longtime contact opens on [reconnecting after a long stretch apart](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_2) and catching up on [mutual history and old ventures](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_24), before turning into a working pitch session. She walks through [her current tiered pricing and openness to feedback on it](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_100), states [the scale and purpose of a bridge raise](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_102), and asks directly [for introductions to funders and customers](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_170). The product thesis centers on [a graph built from ingested organizational decisions functioning as the real moat](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_110), elaborated through [how a client's governance meetings become the actual source of truth](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_78), [the transcript-to-perspective read pattern](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_80), [an append-only, zero-retention architecture](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_84), and [why the graph witnesses statements rather than pre-resolving their meaning](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_92). Mid-call she pivots from that confidence to [an admission that the current front-end story has gotten less clear than the vision once was](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_140), later naming [her own pitch as having regressed in crispness](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_152). She raises [a federation question about sharing access across two people's graphs](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_158), confirms [an accelerator application going in this week](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_162), notes [an existing client's current and pending payment terms](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_214), and closes on [self-directed advice to stop building and go sell](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_246).""" ;
